(3,	NULL,	'<p>Sendes via Post Danmark som en Erhvervspakke</p>',	'<p>Afhentes p&aring; vores lager. Vi sender jer en e-mail n&aring;r ordren er klar til afhentning.</p>',	'<p>Ordren sendes via Post Danmark med l&oslash;rdagsekspres</p>',	'<p>Sendes via GLS som en Erhvervspakke.</p>',	NULL,	NULL,	'kvittering_transportbeskrivelser',	1),
(2,	NULL,	'<p><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Bank transfer to our Middelfart Sparekasse. Reg: 1684 - account: 3225981727 with order no. as reference. The receipt is sent to </span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:faktura@cloudrouter.dk\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">faktura@cloudrouter.dk</span></span></span></span></span></span></a></p>',	'<p>Efterkrav betaling:</p>\r\n<p>Der p&aring;l&oslash;ber efterkravsgebyr og Post Danmark tager kr. 16,00 i gebyr ved afhentning af pakken.Alle efterkravspakker SKAL afhentes p&aring; posthuset!</p>',	'<p><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Payment has been received by credit card.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>',	'<p><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">The order is paid in cash upon pickup. </span></span></span></span></span></span><br /><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Please note we only accept cash in Danish kroner.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>',	'Faktura: ###kredittekst###',	NULL,	'kvittering_betalingsbeskrivelser',	1),
